        "q1": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is included in the Women's Daily Radiance Pack and what is the saving?",
            "answer": "<p>The Women's Daily Radiance Pack contains 3 full-sized products: 1x Her-Biotics Probiotics ORIGINAL Multivitamin Capsules (60s, R299.95), 1x Almasi Probiotics Collagen Peptides Powder (200g, R419.95), and 1x Velo16 Probiotics Vitamin C (60s, R299.95). Total retail value is R1,019.85, but you pay R866.87, saving R152.98 when purchased as a pack.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I take the three products in my daily routine?",
            "answer": "<p>Take 1 Her-Biotics Original Multivitamin capsule and 1 Velo16 Vitamin C capsule daily with water during or after a meal. Mix 1 scoop (approx. 10g) of Almasi Collagen Peptides Powder daily into water, juice, tea, coffee, or a smoothie.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I take this pack during pregnancy or while taking medication?",
            "answer": "<p>If you are pregnant, nursing, taking prescription medication, or have a medical condition, please check with your healthcare professional before starting any new supplement regimen.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does micro-shielding technology work in these products?",
            "answer": "<p>Velobiotics patented polymer encapsulation creates a micro-shield around each individual bacterium, protecting live probiotic cultures from harsh stomach acid so they arrive alive in your gut to support gut flora and nutrient utilisation.</p>"
          }
        },
